        </style><div xmlns="" class="content_block"><h2 class="auth__title">Предельная продолжительность рабочего времени на работах с особо вредными и особо опасными условиями труда  </h2><div class="doc-snippet"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfash28tdh/" data-dfa="dfash28tdh"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr3/"></a>В таблице – продолжительность рабочего дня в часах на работах с особо вредными и особо опасными условиями труда по видам работ </div><div id="documentBody" class="content-common"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasosu4ta/" data-dfa="dfasosu4ta"></a></p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide scroller-wrapper"><div class="scroller table-scroller"><div class="scroller__container"><table width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdAll" style="width:7%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr4/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasllicz8/" data-dfa="dfasllicz8"></a><strong>N</strong></p></td><td class="bdAll" style="width:70%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr5/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasxrq0d4/" data-dfa="dfasxrq0d4"></a><strong>Наименование работ</strong></p></td><td class="bdAll" style="width:16%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr6/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasvc7mvg/" data-dfa="dfasvc7mvg"></a>&nbsp;</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr7/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfassza4aw/" data-dfa="dfassza4aw"></a><strong>Продолжительность</strong></p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr8/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfas94pa1a/" data-dfa="dfas94pa1a"></a><strong>рабочего дня, час</strong></p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr9/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasgi4r8h/" data-dfa="dfasgi4r8h"></a>&nbsp;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" style="width:7%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr10/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasg8zcrg/" data-dfa="dfasg8zcrg"></a>1</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr11/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasggyt30/" data-dfa="dfasggyt30"></a>&nbsp;</p></td><td class="bdTopbdBottombdRight" style="width:70%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr12/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasetg0az/" data-dfa="dfasetg0az"></a>2</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:16%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr13/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasmikgfn/" data-dfa="dfasmikgfn"></a>3</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" colspan="3"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr14/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasxlr2hh/" data-dfa="dfasxlr2hh"></a>&nbsp;</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr15/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasibvher/" data-dfa="dfasibvher"></a><strong>ОБОГАЩЕНИЕ РУД ЦВЕТНЫХ И РЕДКИХ МЕТАЛЛОВ, А ТАКЖЕ</strong></p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr16/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfas9x93oq/" data-dfa="dfas9x93oq"></a><strong>АЛМАЗНОГО СЫРЬЯ И ПЛАВИКОВОГО ШПАТА, КРОМЕ </strong></p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr17/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasvx9n1h/" data-dfa="dfasvx9n1h"></a><strong>НИОБИЕВЫХ (ЛОПАРИТОВЫХ) РУД</strong></p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr18/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfas97lumg/" data-dfa="dfas97lumg"></a>&nbsp;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" style="width:7%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr19/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfas8f7wk3/" data-dfa="dfas8f7wk3"></a>1.</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:70%"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr20/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfas2kvmbs/" data-dfa="dfas2kvmbs"></a>Лаборант-рентгеноструктурщик (обслуживающий рентгеноаппарат)</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr21/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasp8a9wn/" data-dfa="dfasp8a9wn"></a>&nbsp;</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:16%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr22/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasthyqsl/" data-dfa="dfasthyqsl"></a>5</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" colspan="3"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr23/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasag4ark/" data-dfa="dfasag4ark"></a>&nbsp;</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr24/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfas1256ib/" data-dfa="dfas1256ib"></a><strong>ПРОИЗВОДСТВО РТУТИ</strong></p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr25/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasrd9cq0/" data-dfa="dfasrd9cq0"></a>&nbsp;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" style="width:7%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr26/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfaspkvetr/" data-dfa="dfaspkvetr"></a>2.</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:70%"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr27/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasa9h74d/" data-dfa="dfasa9h74d"></a>Конденсаторщик</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr28/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfas8bqhcg/" data-dfa="dfas8bqhcg"></a>&nbsp;</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:16%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr29/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasq35uwl/" data-dfa="dfasq35uwl"></a>4</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" style="width:7%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr30/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasg9zhw2/" data-dfa="dfasg9zhw2"></a>3.</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:70%"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr31/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfas06650e/" data-dfa="dfas06650e"></a>Отбивщик ртути, занятый:</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr32/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasgyd9eh/" data-dfa="dfasgyd9eh"></a>&nbsp;</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:16%"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr33/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfas0gppw5/" data-dfa="dfas0gppw5"></a>&nbsp;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" style="width:7%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr34/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasxvd4ce/" data-dfa="dfasxvd4ce"></a>а)</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:70%"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr35/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfas44lrm6/" data-dfa="dfas44lrm6"></a>на ручной отбивке</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr36/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasvp7oxh/" data-dfa="dfasvp7oxh"></a>&nbsp;</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:16%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr37/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfascwq9ds/" data-dfa="dfascwq9ds"></a>4</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" style="width:7%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr38/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfas3ugz1y/" data-dfa="dfas3ugz1y"></a>б)</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:70%"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr39/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasup1i18/" data-dfa="dfasup1i18"></a>на механической отбивке</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr40/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasuwmhfq/" data-dfa="dfasuwmhfq"></a>&nbsp;</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:16%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr41/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasvbqc4y/" data-dfa="dfasvbqc4y"></a>4</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" colspan="3"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr42/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasgu4vld/" data-dfa="dfasgu4vld"></a>&nbsp;</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr43/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfaszqtvqa/" data-dfa="dfaszqtvqa"></a><strong>ПРОИЗВОДСТВО ЖЕЛТОГО ФОСФОРА</strong></p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr44/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasz7u11l/" data-dfa="dfasz7u11l"></a>&nbsp;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" style="width:7%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr45/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasvy6xll/" data-dfa="dfasvy6xll"></a>4.</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:70%"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr46/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasaeuzod/" data-dfa="dfasaeuzod"></a>Рабочие и инженерно-технические работники (далее - ИТР), за исключением рабочих и ИТР дробильно-сушильного отделения</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr47/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfaslq5lpe/" data-dfa="dfaslq5lpe"></a>&nbsp;</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:16%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr48/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasc2n7bn/" data-dfa="dfasc2n7bn"></a>4</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" colspan="3"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr49/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfaszdrcqu/" data-dfa="dfaszdrcqu"></a>&nbsp;</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr50/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasie3tyz/" data-dfa="dfasie3tyz"></a><strong>ПРОИЗВОДСТВО КАРБИДА КАЛЬЦИЯ</strong></p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr51/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasr3h31u/" data-dfa="dfasr3h31u"></a>&nbsp;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" style="width:7%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr52/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasr8efv0/" data-dfa="dfasr8efv0"></a>5.</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:70%"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr53/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfaswhuhwt/" data-dfa="dfaswhuhwt"></a>Аппаратчик сплавления, шихтовщик, электродчик, сливщик карбида, бригадиры и сменные ИТР на немеханизированных печах</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr54/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasbazgeb/" data-dfa="dfasbazgeb"></a>&nbsp;</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:16%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr55/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfaskvzeb4/" data-dfa="dfaskvzeb4"></a>5</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" colspan="3"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr56/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasqce782/" data-dfa="dfasqce782"></a>&nbsp;</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr57/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasng03c0/" data-dfa="dfasng03c0"></a><strong>ПРОИЗВОДСТВО КАРБОНИЛА НИКЕЛЯ</strong></p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr58/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfaso6vspt/" data-dfa="dfaso6vspt"></a>&nbsp;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" style="width:7%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr59/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfas3hg9ii/" data-dfa="dfas3hg9ii"></a>6.</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:70%"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr60/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfashh5vum/" data-dfa="dfashh5vum"></a>Рабочие и сменные ИТР</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr61/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasudzp0c/" data-dfa="dfasudzp0c"></a>&nbsp;</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:16%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr62/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasuxuw8p/" data-dfa="dfasuxuw8p"></a>4</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" colspan="3"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr63/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfassbupez/" data-dfa="dfassbupez"></a>&nbsp;</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr64/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasagekmp/" data-dfa="dfasagekmp"></a><strong>ПРОИЗВОДСТВО ГРАНОЗАНА, МЕРКУРАНА, МЕРКУРБЕНЗОЛА</strong></p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr65/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfastb3g0b/" data-dfa="dfastb3g0b"></a>&nbsp;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" style="width:7%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr66/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasasuuyt/" data-dfa="dfasasuuyt"></a>7.</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:70%"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr67/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasng4ko3/" data-dfa="dfasng4ko3"></a>Рабочие и сменные ИТР, непосредственно занятые в отделениях приемки ртути, приготовления амальгам, синтеза диэтилртути, этилмеркурхлорида, этилмеркурфосфата, смешения, фасовки и комплектации, очистки сточных вод регенерации угля</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr68/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasywgpcg/" data-dfa="dfasywgpcg"></a>&nbsp;</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:16%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr69/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfas3qfl5k/" data-dfa="dfas3qfl5k"></a>4</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" style="width:7%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr70/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasxvx2qg/" data-dfa="dfasxvx2qg"></a>8.</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:70%"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr71/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfas6bt4k8/" data-dfa="dfas6bt4k8"></a>Механик (техник) по эксплуатации и ремонту специальных санитарных и очистных машин и оборудования, дезактиваторщик, слесарь-сантехник (служба санитарного контроля), обслуживающие санпропускник</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr72/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfas1c3y9s/" data-dfa="dfas1c3y9s"></a>&nbsp;</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:16%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr73/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfaspsulvh/" data-dfa="dfaspsulvh"></a>4</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" colspan="3"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr74/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasotupfn/" data-dfa="dfasotupfn"></a>&nbsp;</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr75/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfashgfkh3/" data-dfa="dfashgfkh3"></a><strong>ПРОИЗВОДСТВО ЭТИЛОВОЙ ЖИДКОСТИ </strong></p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr76/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasgognlk/" data-dfa="dfasgognlk"></a><strong>(ОСНОВНОЕ ПРОИЗВОДСТВО)</strong></p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr77/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfas40e5bl/" data-dfa="dfas40e5bl"></a>&nbsp;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" style="width:7%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr78/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasllggz8/" data-dfa="dfasllggz8"></a>9.</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:70%"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr79/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasfe9i7z/" data-dfa="dfasfe9i7z"></a>Рабочие и сменные ИТР</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr80/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasq9onbx/" data-dfa="dfasq9onbx"></a>&nbsp;</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:16%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr81/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfase4z2dn/" data-dfa="dfase4z2dn"></a>4</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" style="width:7%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr82/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfas8g4920/" data-dfa="dfas8g4920"></a>10.</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:70%"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr83/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasi88ewv/" data-dfa="dfasi88ewv"></a>Рабочие и сменные ИТР отделения обработки возвратной тары</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr84/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasizcb8v/" data-dfa="dfasizcb8v"></a>&nbsp;</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:16%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr85/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfaszfso4h/" data-dfa="dfaszfso4h"></a>4</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" style="width:7%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr86/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasi810fo/" data-dfa="dfasi810fo"></a>11.</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:70%"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr87/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfaswqt1sx/" data-dfa="dfaswqt1sx"></a>Рабочие и сменные ИТР очистки и использования цеховых производственных сточных вод и газов</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr88/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfaszg0fs4/" data-dfa="dfaszg0fs4"></a>&nbsp;</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:16%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr89/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasnaozbk/" data-dfa="dfasnaozbk"></a>4</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" colspan="3"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr90/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasn2hund/" data-dfa="dfasn2hund"></a>&nbsp;</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr91/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfashghvur/" data-dfa="dfashghvur"></a><strong>УТИЛИЗАЦИОННЫЕ ЦЕХА И ОТДЕЛЕНИЯ ПО ПЕРЕРАБОТКЕ РЫБЫ, </strong></p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr92/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasxz4qy8/" data-dfa="dfasxz4qy8"></a><strong>МОРЗВЕРЯ И МЯСА, НЕ ПОДЛЕЖАЩИХ ПЕРЕРАБОТКЕ </strong></p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr93/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasan7zsq/" data-dfa="dfasan7zsq"></a><strong>ДЛЯ ПИЩЕВЫХ ЦЕЛЕЙ</strong></p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr94/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasni6wgw/" data-dfa="dfasni6wgw"></a>&nbsp;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" style="width:7%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr95/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfas9sx1on/" data-dfa="dfas9sx1on"></a>12.</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:70%"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr96/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasbo5p5i/" data-dfa="dfasbo5p5i"></a>Рабочие и сменные ИТР, занятые обеззараживанием, переработкой трупов и конфискатов</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr97/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfas1skgho/" data-dfa="dfas1skgho"></a>&nbsp;</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:16%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr98/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfaszhplev/" data-dfa="dfaszhplev"></a>5</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" colspan="3"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr99/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasf61ubk/" data-dfa="dfasf61ubk"></a>&nbsp;</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr100/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasvgmdx1/" data-dfa="dfasvgmdx1"></a><strong>ЭКСПЛУАТАЦИЯ МЕТРОПОЛИТЕНА</strong></p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr101/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasx4zoak/" data-dfa="dfasx4zoak"></a><strong>(постоянная работа только в ночное время в тоннелях)</strong></p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr102/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasw3y6m5/" data-dfa="dfasw3y6m5"></a>&nbsp;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" style="width:7%"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr103/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasgliwgc/" data-dfa="dfasgliwgc"></a>&nbsp;</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:70%"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr104/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfascs3g9k/" data-dfa="dfascs3g9k"></a>Рабочие:</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr105/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfaslckzn1/" data-dfa="dfaslckzn1"></a>&nbsp;</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:16%"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr106/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasz0oe2b/" data-dfa="dfasz0oe2b"></a>&nbsp;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" style="width:7%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr107/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfascqu39s/" data-dfa="dfascqu39s"></a>13.</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:70%"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr108/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasiy91qg/" data-dfa="dfasiy91qg"></a>Бригадир (напосредственно работающий) предприятий железнодорожного транспорта и метрополитенов</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr109/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfas40t96h/" data-dfa="dfas40t96h"></a>&nbsp;</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:16%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr110/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfaseht1zt/" data-dfa="dfaseht1zt"></a>5</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" style="width:7%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr111/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfaswl9b7r/" data-dfa="dfaswl9b7r"></a>14.</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:70%"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr112/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasb8qun1/" data-dfa="dfasb8qun1"></a>Вулканизаторщик и ремонтировщик резиновых изделий, занятые на ремонте поручней эскалаторов</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr113/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasg2wgs3/" data-dfa="dfasg2wgs3"></a>&nbsp;</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:16%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr114/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasmi4vhv/" data-dfa="dfasmi4vhv"></a>5</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" style="width:7%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr115/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasdnf3q9/" data-dfa="dfasdnf3q9"></a>15.</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:70%"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr116/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasw64p7l/" data-dfa="dfasw64p7l"></a>Дренажник</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr117/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfaslzvrm4/" data-dfa="dfaslzvrm4"></a>&nbsp;</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:16%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr118/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasgmrogd/" data-dfa="dfasgmrogd"></a>5</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" style="width:7%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr119/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasldw5rh/" data-dfa="dfasldw5rh"></a>16.</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:70%"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr120/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfaskdbqux/" data-dfa="dfaskdbqux"></a>Маляр, штукатур, столяр, слесарь-ремонтник, обслуживающие оборудование тоннельных сооружений</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr121/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasnbb3f6/" data-dfa="dfasnbb3f6"></a>&nbsp;</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:16%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr122/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasx9df68/" data-dfa="dfasx9df68"></a>5</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" style="width:7%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr123/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfaslw2za9/" data-dfa="dfaslw2za9"></a>17.</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:70%"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr124/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfaspy70rh/" data-dfa="dfaspy70rh"></a>Машинист зумпфового агрегата</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr125/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasppqh61/" data-dfa="dfasppqh61"></a>&nbsp;</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:16%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr126/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasgmynw9/" data-dfa="dfasgmynw9"></a>5</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" style="width:7%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr127/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfas1z58qc/" data-dfa="dfas1z58qc"></a>18.</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:70%"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr128/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasbkyyov/" data-dfa="dfasbkyyov"></a>Машинист моечной установки, машинист компрессорных установок, помощник машиниста компрессорных установок</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr129/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasoa7x09/" data-dfa="dfasoa7x09"></a>&nbsp;</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:16%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr130/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasf5g4lu/" data-dfa="dfasf5g4lu"></a>5</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" style="width:7%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr131/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfaso55ge6/" data-dfa="dfaso55ge6"></a>19.</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:70%"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr132/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasftzt7z/" data-dfa="dfasftzt7z"></a>Машинист мотовоза, водитель дрезины, помощник водителя дрезины (занятые на хозяйственных поездах)</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr133/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasfpryxy/" data-dfa="dfasfpryxy"></a>&nbsp;</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:16%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr134/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasu7wfk8/" data-dfa="dfasu7wfk8"></a>5</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" style="width:7%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr135/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfas3ez8an/" data-dfa="dfas3ez8an"></a>20.</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:70%"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr136/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasrab60r/" data-dfa="dfasrab60r"></a>Монтер пути, стрелочник</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr137/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasy5vnwy/" data-dfa="dfasy5vnwy"></a>&nbsp;</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:16%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr138/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasgqf5wk/" data-dfa="dfasgqf5wk"></a>5</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" style="width:7%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr139/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfas6w2lu4/" data-dfa="dfas6w2lu4"></a>21.</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:70%"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr140/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfas9odkcg/" data-dfa="dfas9odkcg"></a>Облицовщик-мраморщик, облицовщик-плиточник, облицовщик-полировщик</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr141/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasfsh7f5/" data-dfa="dfasfsh7f5"></a>&nbsp;</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:16%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr142/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfaso2t9br/" data-dfa="dfaso2t9br"></a>5</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" style="width:7%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr143/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfas5sggvw/" data-dfa="dfas5sggvw"></a>22.</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:70%"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr144/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasg347l0/" data-dfa="dfasg347l0"></a>Обходчик искусственных сооружений и железнодорожных путей, рабочий по ремонту железнодорожного пути</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr145/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfas1qisqv/" data-dfa="dfas1qisqv"></a>&nbsp;</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:16%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr146/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasfi0ah0/" data-dfa="dfasfi0ah0"></a>5</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" style="width:7%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr147/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfaso7hhgf/" data-dfa="dfaso7hhgf"></a>23.</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:70%"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr148/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasxedel5/" data-dfa="dfasxedel5"></a>Оператор дефектоскопной тележки, оператор по путевым измерениям и их помощники</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr149/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasg503zw/" data-dfa="dfasg503zw"></a>&nbsp;</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:16%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr150/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasnw2lrb/" data-dfa="dfasnw2lrb"></a>5</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" style="width:7%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr151/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfaszyg8so/" data-dfa="dfaszyg8so"></a>24.</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:70%"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr152/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasrg31al/" data-dfa="dfasrg31al"></a>Раздатчик инструмента, кладовщик</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr153/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasoe3pwn/" data-dfa="dfasoe3pwn"></a>&nbsp;</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:16%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr154/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfas520erw/" data-dfa="dfas520erw"></a>5</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" style="width:7%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr155/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfashflkr5/" data-dfa="dfashflkr5"></a>25.</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:70%"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr156/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfas94vgel/" data-dfa="dfas94vgel"></a>Слесарь зумпфового агрегата</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr157/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfaslh6gm6/" data-dfa="dfaslh6gm6"></a>&nbsp;</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:16%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr158/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfas4wk5y4/" data-dfa="dfas4wk5y4"></a>5</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" style="width:7%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr159/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasxcncdt/" data-dfa="dfasxcncdt"></a>26.</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:70%"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr160/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasc0vl11/" data-dfa="dfasc0vl11"></a>Тоннельный рабочий</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr161/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfas8atfl9/" data-dfa="dfas8atfl9"></a>&nbsp;</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:16%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr162/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasag6ev7/" data-dfa="dfasag6ev7"></a>5</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" style="width:7%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr163/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfas4xce0g/" data-dfa="dfas4xce0g"></a>27.</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:70%"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr164/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasy5gfvx/" data-dfa="dfasy5gfvx"></a>Электромонтажник по кабельным сетям, электромонтажник по вторичным цепям, электромонтажник по освещению и осветительным сетям, электромонтажник по силовым сетям и электрооборудованию</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr165/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfaszlxuvx/" data-dfa="dfaszlxuvx"></a>&nbsp;</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:16%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr166/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasr2gs91/" data-dfa="dfasr2gs91"></a>5</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" style="width:7%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr167/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfas6s95zc/" data-dfa="dfas6s95zc"></a>28.</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:70%"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr168/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasz49di5/" data-dfa="dfasz49di5"></a>Электромонтер диспетчерского оборудования и телеавтоматики, электромонтер по ремонту электрооборудования, электромонтер по обслуживанию электрооборудования</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr169/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfastdfxgi/" data-dfa="dfastdfxgi"></a>&nbsp;</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:16%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr170/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfaswme7zr/" data-dfa="dfaswme7zr"></a>5</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" style="width:7%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr171/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfas7agclx/" data-dfa="dfas7agclx"></a>29.</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:70%"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr172/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasfgqwzt/" data-dfa="dfasfgqwzt"></a>Связист (электромонтер связи), электромонтер устройств сигнализации, централизации, блокировки</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr173/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasmzycwi/" data-dfa="dfasmzycwi"></a>&nbsp;</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:16%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr174/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfaslysvpb/" data-dfa="dfaslysvpb"></a>5</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" style="width:7%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr175/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasfv3so2/" data-dfa="dfasfv3so2"></a>30.</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:70%"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr176/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfas9ir3dp/" data-dfa="dfas9ir3dp"></a>Старший мастер, мастер, помощник мастера</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr177/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfas2q78km/" data-dfa="dfas2q78km"></a>&nbsp;</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:16%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr178/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasc371yi/" data-dfa="dfasc371yi"></a>5</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" style="width:7%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr179/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasxhzibw/" data-dfa="dfasxhzibw"></a>31.</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:70%"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr180/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasgh0gzb/" data-dfa="dfasgh0gzb"></a>Старший электромеханик, электромеханик</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr181/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfas4oqgq4/" data-dfa="dfas4oqgq4"></a>&nbsp;</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:16%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr182/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasev24fh/" data-dfa="dfasev24fh"></a>5</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" style="width:7%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr183/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfas2o74y8/" data-dfa="dfas2o74y8"></a>32.</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:70%"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr184/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasaoemg8/" data-dfa="dfasaoemg8"></a>Старший техник-маркшейдер, техник-маркшейдер (при выполнении геодезическо-маркшейдерских работ)</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr185/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfaspga62f/" data-dfa="dfaspga62f"></a>&nbsp;</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:16%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr186/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfas7ycpdv/" data-dfa="dfas7ycpdv"></a>5</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" colspan="3"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr187/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfas1o6dlm/" data-dfa="dfas1o6dlm"></a>&nbsp;</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr188/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfaskw0tgc/" data-dfa="dfaskw0tgc"></a><strong>ПРОИЗВОДСТВО БИОПРЕПАРАТОВ</strong></p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr189/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasm2l52c/" data-dfa="dfasm2l52c"></a>&nbsp;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" style="width:7%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr190/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfas4gdz6b/" data-dfa="dfas4gdz6b"></a>33.</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:70%"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr191/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasf3ezov/" data-dfa="dfasf3ezov"></a>Работники, постоянно и непосредственно занятые на работах на утилизационных установках по обеззараживанию и утилизации трупов животных</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr192/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfas4ils73/" data-dfa="dfas4ils73"></a>&nbsp;</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:16%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr193/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfastn22t1/" data-dfa="dfastn22t1"></a>5</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" colspan="3"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr194/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfas36ga3c/" data-dfa="dfas36ga3c"></a>&nbsp;</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr195/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasaoue1g/" data-dfa="dfasaoue1g"></a><strong>ВЕТЕРИНАРИЯ</strong></p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr196/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfaseml2u7/" data-dfa="dfaseml2u7"></a>&nbsp;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" style="width:7%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr197/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfaster5lk/" data-dfa="dfaster5lk"></a>34.</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:70%"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr198/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasgx6aa9/" data-dfa="dfasgx6aa9"></a>Работники, постоянно и непосредственно занятые обеззараживанием, перевозкой и утилизацией трупов животных и конфискатов на утилизационных предприятиях</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr199/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfastrhn0c/" data-dfa="dfastrhn0c"></a>&nbsp;</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:16%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr200/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasgy89q3/" data-dfa="dfasgy89q3"></a>5</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" colspan="3"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr201/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasgz0erx/" data-dfa="dfasgz0erx"></a>&nbsp;</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr202/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfaszcid8g/" data-dfa="dfaszcid8g"></a><strong>РАБОТНИКИ, ЗАНЯТЫЕ НА РАБОТЕ С ТРУПАМИ </strong></p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr203/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfaseb8qex/" data-dfa="dfaseb8qex"></a><strong>И ТРУПНЫМ МАТЕРИАЛОМ</strong></p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr204/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasxsw69e/" data-dfa="dfasxsw69e"></a>&nbsp;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" style="width:7%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr205/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasqvtggo/" data-dfa="dfasqvtggo"></a>35.</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:70%"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr206/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasup3l34/" data-dfa="dfasup3l34"></a>Врач (в том числе врач-руководитель отделения, лаборатории), средний и младший медицинский персонал, уборщик производственных помещений</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr207/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfaserezoc/" data-dfa="dfaserezoc"></a>&nbsp;</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:16%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr208/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfascqk4gm/" data-dfa="dfascqk4gm"></a>5</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" style="width:7%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr209/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfas0h7vc4/" data-dfa="dfas0h7vc4"></a>36.</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:70%"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr210/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasi63qnq/" data-dfa="dfasi63qnq"></a>Работники научно-исследовательских институтов, клиник, работающие в прозекторских и моргах, а также работники кафедр нормальной, патологической и топографической анатомии, судебной медицины и оперативной хирургии при постоянной работе с трупами и трупным материалом</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr211/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasgoyk38/" data-dfa="dfasgoyk38"></a>&nbsp;</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:16%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr212/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasgo8oxx/" data-dfa="dfasgo8oxx"></a>5</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" colspan="3"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr213/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasgpvwxi/" data-dfa="dfasgpvwxi"></a>&nbsp;</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr214/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasn5w5nr/" data-dfa="dfasn5w5nr"></a><strong>БЮРО СУДЕБНО-МЕДИЦИНСКОЙ ЭКСПЕРТИЗЫ</strong></p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr215/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasilffl7/" data-dfa="dfasilffl7"></a>&nbsp;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" style="width:7%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr216/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfas4p0kf2/" data-dfa="dfas4p0kf2"></a>37.</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:70%"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr217/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasi18g68/" data-dfa="dfasi18g68"></a>Государственный судебно-медицинский эксперт-специалист (эксперт), начальник структурного подразделения (управления, отдела, сектора) судебный эксперт-специалист (эксперт), средний и младший медицинский персонал</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr218/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfas4g81qi/" data-dfa="dfas4g81qi"></a>&nbsp;</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:16%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr219/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasizgg2r/" data-dfa="dfasizgg2r"></a>5</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" colspan="3"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr220/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfas1wufsc/" data-dfa="dfas1wufsc"></a>&nbsp;</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr221/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfas0nnoyp/" data-dfa="dfas0nnoyp"></a><strong>ОБЩИЕ ПРОФЕССИИ МЕДИЦИНСКИХ РАБОТНИКОВ </strong></p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr222/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasv6imta/" data-dfa="dfasv6imta"></a><strong>УЧРЕЖДЕНИЙ ЗДРАВООХРАНЕНИЯ, СОЦИАЛЬНОГО </strong></p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr223/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasmcyip2/" data-dfa="dfasmcyip2"></a><strong>ОБЕСПЕЧЕНИЯ И ОБРАЗОВАНИЯ</strong></p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr224/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasy3b8gg/" data-dfa="dfasy3b8gg"></a>&nbsp;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" style="width:7%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr225/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasrt9hl6/" data-dfa="dfasrt9hl6"></a>38.</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:70%"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr226/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasc27tn3/" data-dfa="dfasc27tn3"></a>Работники лабораторий, отделений и отделов, занятые заготовкой и консервацией трупной крови и трупных тканей</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr227/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasw5x3f2/" data-dfa="dfasw5x3f2"></a>&nbsp;</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:16%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr228/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfast2rc3f/" data-dfa="dfast2rc3f"></a>5</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" colspan="3"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr229/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfaslk8qy4/" data-dfa="dfaslk8qy4"></a>&nbsp;</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr230/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasags034/" data-dfa="dfasags034"></a><strong>ПРИМЕНЕНИЕ РАДИОАКТИВНЫХ ВЕЩЕСТВ В КАЧЕСТВЕ</strong></p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr231/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfaspea81e/" data-dfa="dfaspea81e"></a><strong>ИСТОЧНИКОВ ГАММА-ИЗЛУЧЕНИЯ</strong></p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr232/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasv3a8kn/" data-dfa="dfasv3a8kn"></a>&nbsp;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" style="width:7%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr233/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfassl0o8f/" data-dfa="dfassl0o8f"></a>39.</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:70%"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr234/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasot0iu2/" data-dfa="dfasot0iu2"></a>Работники, непосредственно занятые на гамма-терапии и экспериментальном гамма-облучении:</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr235/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfas9r9bio/" data-dfa="dfas9r9bio"></a>&nbsp;</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:16%"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr236/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasfmidsu/" data-dfa="dfasfmidsu"></a>&nbsp;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" style="width:7%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr237/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasau4nbu/" data-dfa="dfasau4nbu"></a>а)</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:70%"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr238/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasf6k8y3/" data-dfa="dfasf6k8y3"></a>в палатах по обслуживанию больных с наложенными радиоактивными препаратами</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr239/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasu2ucdu/" data-dfa="dfasu2ucdu"></a>&nbsp;</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:16%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr240/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfas50gu9k/" data-dfa="dfas50gu9k"></a>5</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" style="width:7%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr241/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfas2h8zys/" data-dfa="dfas2h8zys"></a>б)</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:70%"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr242/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasy8vgea/" data-dfa="dfasy8vgea"></a>работающие с гамма-установками</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr243/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasuo37di/" data-dfa="dfasuo37di"></a>&nbsp;</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:16%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr244/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasd6ropw/" data-dfa="dfasd6ropw"></a>5</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" style="width:7%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr245/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasx5oodd/" data-dfa="dfasx5oodd"></a>в)</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:70%"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr246/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfas5ogk17/" data-dfa="dfas5ogk17"></a>работающие с гамма-препаратами в радиоманипуляционных кабинетах и лабораториях</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr247/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasy3z5gv/" data-dfa="dfasy3z5gv"></a>&nbsp;</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:16%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr248/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasfsf7fk/" data-dfa="dfasfsf7fk"></a>4</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" colspan="3"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr249/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasvvb5rf/" data-dfa="dfasvvb5rf"></a>&nbsp;</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr250/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasg833vo/" data-dfa="dfasg833vo"></a><strong>РЕНТГЕНОВСКОЕ ИЗЛУЧЕНИЕ</strong></p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr251/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfas6umsy8/" data-dfa="dfas6umsy8"></a>&nbsp;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" style="width:7%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr252/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasz4sd5b/" data-dfa="dfasz4sd5b"></a>40.</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:70%"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr253/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfas87w1hr/" data-dfa="dfas87w1hr"></a>Работники, непосредственно занятые на установках рентгеноспектрального, рентгеноструктурного анализа, промышленной рентгенографии и контроле растров рентгеновских решеток</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr254/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfas14whia/" data-dfa="dfas14whia"></a>&nbsp;</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:16%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr255/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfastkvv2n/" data-dfa="dfastkvv2n"></a>5</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" style="width:7%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr256/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasy2r27w/" data-dfa="dfasy2r27w"></a>41.</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:70%"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr257/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasmau4sr/" data-dfa="dfasmau4sr"></a>Работники, непосредственно занятые на рентгенодиагностике, флюорографии, на ротационной рентгенотерапевтической установке с визуальным контролем</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr258/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasph6s4q/" data-dfa="dfasph6s4q"></a>&nbsp;</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:16%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/bssPhr259/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/218627/dfasg9wyyi/" data-dfa="dfasg9wyyi"></a>5</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="scroller__track  scroller__track_h"><div class="scroller__bar scroller__bar_h"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div xmlns="" class="footer">© Материал из ЭС "ACTION: Главбух"<br />https://1gb.uz<br />Дата копирования: 28.09.2026</div></body></html>